---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Yakub Blog" description="Learn about Yakub Blog, a focused source for Bangladesh job circulars and career guidance.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><p class="pill !cursor-default">About us</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-paper">Useful information for your next career move.</h1><div class="prose mt-8 max-w-none dark:prose-invert"><p>Yakub Blog organizes Bangladesh government, bank, private, university job circulars, results, and notices into clear, searchable pages.</p><p>We summarize published notices for convenience and link readers back to the issuing organization's official portal for final verification.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
